<title>MALAYSIA: Khong Guan says eyes two properties.</title>
<headline>Khong Guan says eyes two properties.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Khong Guan Holdings Malaysia Bhd said it was negotiating to buy two properties in southern Johor state.</p>
<p>No other details were given in the company's statement received on Monday.</p>
<p>The property and confectionery requested the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange to continue suspending its stock.</p>
<p>Khong Guan stock was last traded on May 30 at 10.60 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
